```java
// Causes StackOverflowError — missing base case
public int factorial(int n) {
    return n * factorial(n - 1); // no base case!
}

// Fixed: with base case
public int factorial(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return 1; // base case
    return n * factorial(n - 1);
}
```

